{"seq":2,"slug":"third-party-return-processor","title":"第三方退货处理商地址接入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-return-address-registry/return-address-registry/third-party-return-processor","wordCount":2111,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"第三方退货处理商地址接入\">第三方退货处理商地址接入</h1><p>自营退货仓的地址由自己维护，第三方退货处理商的地址由对方维护——这是本 hub 里唯一一处<strong>权威源在组织边界之外</strong>的地址数据。这个差别看起来只是「谁来更新」，实际会改变整个数据模型：你需要区分对面在合同上承诺的地址和实际作业的地址，需要处理对方换址时的通知时延，也需要在对方失联或倒闭时能立刻把流量切走。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-合同地址与作业地址\">核心概念：合同地址与作业地址</h2><p>第三方退货处理商（3PRP，third-party return processor）通常同时存在至少两个地址，它们在业务上不可互换：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>地址类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>变更来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>注册/合同地址 legal address</td>\n<td>合同主体登记地址，出现在合同、发票、报关单据上</td>\n<td>结算、开票、法律送达</td>\n<td>对方工商变更，极低频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>作业地址 operating address</td>\n<td>实际收件与处理退货的场所</td>\n<td>退货标签 ship-to、路由候选</td>\n<td>对方租约与产能调整，中高频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交接点 handover point</td>\n<td>作业地址内具体的收件入口与时段</td>\n<td>面单 ship-to 的精确落点</td>\n<td>对方排班调整，高频</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把这三者压成一个「处理商地址」字段，会导致三类具体故障：面单发到注册地址（收件方是一个写字楼前台，退货包裹无人签收后按无人认领销毁）；发票上的地址与实际作业地不符（跨境税务与关税申报时被质疑）；换址后路由仍指向旧作业地（在途退货全部寄错）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  V[3PRP 供应商档案] --&gt; L[合同地址&lt;br/&gt;结算/开票/报关]&#10;  V --&gt; O[作业地址&lt;br/&gt;退货标签 ship-to]&#10;  O --&gt; H1[交接点 A 口&lt;br/&gt;工作日 09-17]&#10;  O --&gt; H2[交接点 B 口&lt;br/&gt;整托预约]&#10;  O --&gt; C[能力声明&lt;br/&gt;可收类别/地域/时效]&#10;  L -.变更低频.-&gt; S[数据同步策略]&#10;  O -.变更中频.-&gt; S&#10;  H1 -.变更高频.-&gt; S&#10;  C --&gt; R[路由候选池]&#10;  O --&gt; R\">graph TD\n  V[3PRP 供应商档案] --&gt; L[合同地址&lt;br/&gt;结算/开票/报关]\n  V --&gt; O[作业地址&lt;br/&gt;退货标签 ship-to]\n  O --&gt; H1[交接点 A 口&lt;br/&gt;工作日 09-17]\n  O --&gt; H2[交接点 B 口&lt;br/&gt;整托预约]\n  O --&gt; C[能力声明&lt;br/&gt;可收类别/地域/时效]\n  L -.变更低频.-&gt; S[数据同步策略]\n  O -.变更中频.-&gt; S\n  H1 -.变更高频.-&gt; S\n  C --&gt; R[路由候选池]\n  O --&gt; R</pre><h2 id=\"接入契约-把地址当接口\">接入契约：把地址当接口</h2><h3 id=\"声明式地址包\">声明式地址包</h3><p>接入第三方处理商的第一步不是拿到一个地址字符串，而是让它以<strong>声明式地址包</strong>的形式提供全部收件点及其能力。这份地址包应当是一份可版本化的文档，而不是一段邮件正文里的地址。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;processor_id&quot;: &quot;3PRP-NL-0042&quot;,&#10;  &quot;schema_version&quot;: &quot;1.2&quot;,&#10;  &quot;legal_address&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;country&quot;: &quot;NL&quot;,&#10;    &quot;line1&quot;: &quot;Keizersgracht 100&quot;,&#10;    &quot;city&quot;: &quot;Amsterdam&quot;,&#10;    &quot;postcode&quot;: &quot;1015 CV&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;operating_sites&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;site_ref&quot;: &quot;AMS-DC-2&quot;,&#10;      &quot;active_from&quot;: &quot;2026-02-01&quot;,&#10;      &quot;active_to&quot;: null,&#10;      &quot;address&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;country&quot;: &quot;NL&quot;,&#10;        &quot;line1&quot;: &quot;Hornweg 24&quot;,&#10;        &quot;city&quot;: &quot;Amsterdam&quot;,&#10;        &quot;postcode&quot;: &quot;1045 AR&quot;&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;handover_points&quot;: [&#10;        {&#10;          &quot;point_ref&quot;: &quot;AMS-DC-2-DOCK&quot;,&#10;          &quot;weekdays&quot;: [1, 2, 3, 4, 5],&#10;          &quot;hours&quot;: [&quot;08:00-16:00&quot;],&#10;          &quot;appointment_required&quot;: true,&#10;          &quot;max_weight_kg&quot;: 30&#10;        }&#10;      ],&#10;      &quot;service_regions&quot;: [&quot;NL&quot;, &quot;BE&quot;, &quot;LU&quot;],&#10;      &quot;accepted_goods_classes&quot;: [&quot;general&quot;, &quot;apparel&quot;],&#10;      &quot;forbidden_goods_classes&quot;: [&quot;lithium_standalone&quot;, &quot;flammable_liquid&quot;, &quot;alcohol&quot;]&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"processor_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"3PRP-NL-0042\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"schema_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"legal_address\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"country\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"line1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Keizersgracht 100\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"city\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Amsterdam\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"postcode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1015 CV\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"operating_sites\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"site_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AMS-DC-2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"active_from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-02-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"active_to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"address\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"country\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"line1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Hornweg 24\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"city\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Amsterdam\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"postcode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1045 AR\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"handover_points\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"point_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AMS-DC-2-DOCK\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"weekdays\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"08:00-16:00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"appointment_required\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"max_weight_kg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"service_regions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"LU\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"accepted_goods_classes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"general\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"apparel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"forbidden_goods_classes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lithium_standalone\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"flammable_liquid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"alcohol\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>schema_version</code> 是这份契约能在多个处理商之间复用的前提。不同处理商的能力字段命名必然不同（有人叫 <code>zones</code>、有人叫 <code>regions</code>），接入层负责把它们映射到内部统一词汇，这一段转换属于典型的防腐层：外部模型变化不应该渗透到路由引擎。国家码在这里是硬约束——<code>service_regions</code> 必须用 ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 两字母码，因为国际邮政标识符（如 UPU S10 的最后两位）用的就是这套码（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S10_(UPU_standard)\">S10 (UPU standard)</a>），用国家名或自造缩写会让跨处理商聚合与轨迹关联都无法对齐。</p>\n<h3 id=\"里程碑式的验收检查\">里程碑式的验收检查</h3><p>地址包接入时必须跑一轮可自动化的验收，否则错误会延迟到第一件退货包裹上才暴露。检查项至少包括：每个作业地址的邮编与该国邮编格式规则匹配（第二章的规则在此复用）、<code>service_regions</code> 覆盖了你实际要路由的目的国、<code>active_from</code> 不晚于你计划启用的日期、<code>forbidden_goods_classes</code> 至少包含你目录里的危险品类别。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE processor_operating_site (&#10;  site_ref      TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  processor_id  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  address_id    TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES return_address(address_id),&#10;  active_from   TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  active_to     TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  service_regions TEXT[] NOT NULL,&#10;  accepted_classes TEXT[] NOT NULL,&#10;  forbidden_classes TEXT[] NOT NULL,&#10;  feed_version  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  ingested_at   TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (processor_id, site_ref, active_from)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_pos_region_classes&#10;  ON processor_operating_site USING GIN (service_regions, accepted_classes);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processor_operating_site</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  site_ref      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  processor_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  address_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> return_address(address_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  active_from   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  active_to     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  service_regions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  accepted_classes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  forbidden_classes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  feed_version  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ingested_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (processor_id, site_ref, active_from)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_pos_region_classes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> processor_operating_site </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GIN (service_regions, accepted_classes);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>主键选 <code>(processor_id, site_ref, active_from)</code> 而不是单纯的 <code>site_ref</code>，是为了让同一个作业场地的历史生效窗口可以共存。这是「在途退货单怎么办」这个问题的数据基础——它需要能回查「某单生成那个时刻，这个场地对应的地址是哪一个」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"变更同步-换址与在途保护\">变更同步：换址与在途保护</h2><h3 id=\"换址通知的三种时延\">换址通知的三种时延</h3><p>处理商换址时，从对方决定换址到你系统里路由生效，中间有三段不可压缩的时延。第一段是<strong>对方决策到通知你</strong>，取决于合同是否约定了通知期（常见的约定是提前 30 天，但这属于合同条款，不应在系统设计里假定）。第二段是<strong>通知到你完成数据更新</strong>，取决于你的接入是人工还是自动拉取。第三段是<strong>更新到在途包裹全部走完</strong>，取决于退货包裹的最长在途时间。</p>\n<p>第一段和第二段影响新生成的退货单，第三段影响已经生成的退货单——这是两个完全不同的处理面。</p>\n<h3 id=\"在途保护的落地方式\">在途保护的落地方式</h3><p>对已经生成的退货单，只改地址库是无效的，因为标签早已打印、买家已经在交寄路上。可行的做法是给每条退货单冻结<strong>生成时刻的收件点快照</strong>，并在收件点停用时做一次在途盘点：凡是生成时间早于停用生效时间、且尚未妥投的退货单，全部进入一个过渡队列，由过渡规则决定是继续寄往旧点还是改址。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT r.return_id, r.point_id_snapshot, r.created_at&#10;FROM return_order r&#10;WHERE r.status IN (&#39;label_generated&#39;, &#39;in_transit&#39;)&#10;  AND r.point_id_snapshot = :deprecated_point_id&#10;  AND r.created_at &lt; :deprecate_effective_at;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">return_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">point_id_snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> return_order r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'label_generated'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'in_transit'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">point_id_snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :deprecated_point_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :deprecate_effective_at;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条查询是所有过渡策略的入口。它的输出规模直接决定该走哪条路：如果只有几十单，最省事的做法是让它们继续寄往旧点、由处理商内部转运；如果规模上千单，就需要联系买家改投或由承运商做改址。这个决策属于第一章的<a href=\"../return-address-registry/address-active-deprecate\">地址生效变更与停用管理</a>，本节只负责让它在数据上可行。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数据同步的频率与幂等\">数据同步的频率与幂等</h3><p>处理商地址包的同步应当是全量幂等覆盖而非增量补丁。原因是地址数据量小（一个处理商通常几个到几十个作业点），全量同步的带宽成本可以忽略，而增量补丁会引入「补丁丢失导致长期不一致」这一难以察觉的故障。落地方式是：每次同步写入一个新的 <code>feed_version</code>，以 <code>feed_version</code> 为界比对上一版本的差异，差异记录进审计表（第四章），但<strong>当前状态以最新全量版本为准</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"处理商失灵时的断连设计\">处理商失灵时的断连设计</h2><h3 id=\"断连不是一个异常分支\">断连不是一个异常分支</h3><p>第三方处理商可能破产、可能被海关暂停资质、可能单方面终止合作。这些事件在数据上的表现是一致的：地址包停止更新、作业点不再收件、退货包裹在交接点被拒收。把这类情况当成异常分支处理，会导致「路由引擎仍然选中这个点，因为它在数据库里还是 active」这种最糟糕的结果——系统在明知不可用的情况下继续往那里发货。</p>\n<p>正确的做法是在收件点模型里保留一个<strong>独立于地址变更链路的可用性开关</strong>，它由运营或风控直接控制，不依赖处理商的地址包更新：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"ALTER TABLE processor_operating_site&#10;  ADD COLUMN operational_hold BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT false,&#10;  ADD COLUMN hold_reason TEXT,&#10;  ADD COLUMN hold_at TIMESTAMPTZ;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> processor_operating_site</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ADD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> COLUMN operational_hold </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ADD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> COLUMN hold_reason </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ADD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> COLUMN hold_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>operational_hold</code> 与 <code>active_to</code> 的语义必须区分清楚：<code>active_to</code> 是处理商声明的作业窗口结束（正常生命周期），<code>operational_hold</code> 是我方单方面切断（异常事件）。路由引擎对两者的处理相同——都从候选池移除；但运营看板与审计报告需要区分，因为前者可以提前规划，后者需要立即告警。</p>\n<h3 id=\"兜底点的存在性\">兜底点的存在性</h3><p>任何依赖第三方处理商的路由策略都必须有一个不依赖该处理商的兜底点。兜底点通常是自营海外退货中心，或者是一个长期合约的另一家处理商。这个要求在地址库里的体现是：兜底点在路由规则中的优先级最低但<strong>不可为空</strong>，且它的 <code>operational_hold</code> 需要单独的监控告警——一旦兜底点也被切断，整个市场的退货路由就失效了。这个不可为空的约束与<a href=\"../return-route-assign/return-address-by-goods-market\">按商品类型与市场分配退货地</a>中的兜底链设计是同一个机制的两端。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>第三方处理商的地址必须拆成合同地址、作业地址、交接点三层，面单永远指向交接点。</li>\n<li>接入以声明式地址包加 <code>schema_version</code> 进行，用防腐层把外部字段映射为内部统一词汇，国家码强制用 ISO 3166-1 alpha-2。</li>\n<li>换址的三段时延要分开处理：新单走新地址，在途单靠收件点快照与过渡队列处理。</li>\n<li>全量幂等的地址包同步比增量补丁更可靠，差异进审计而非直接覆盖历史。</li>\n<li>处理商失灵用独立的 <code>operational_hold</code> 开关表达，且必须有不可为空的兜底点。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"第三方退货处理商地址接入","id":"第三方退货处理商地址接入"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：合同地址与作业地址","id":"核心概念-合同地址与作业地址"},{"level":2,"text":"接入契约：把地址当接口","id":"接入契约-把地址当接口"},{"level":3,"text":"声明式地址包","id":"声明式地址包"},{"level":3,"text":"里程碑式的验收检查","id":"里程碑式的验收检查"},{"level":2,"text":"变更同步：换址与在途保护","id":"变更同步-换址与在途保护"},{"level":3,"text":"换址通知的三种时延","id":"换址通知的三种时延"},{"level":3,"text":"在途保护的落地方式","id":"在途保护的落地方式"},{"level":3,"text":"数据同步的频率与幂等","id":"数据同步的频率与幂等"},{"level":2,"text":"处理商失灵时的断连设计","id":"处理商失灵时的断连设计"},{"level":3,"text":"断连不是一个异常分支","id":"断连不是一个异常分支"},{"level":3,"text":"兜底点的存在性","id":"兜底点的存在性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"海外退货中心与本地退仓地址库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-return-address-registry/return-address-registry/overseas-return-center-address"},"next":{"title":"地址生效变更与停用管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-return-address-registry/return-address-registry/address-active-deprecate"}}